<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Machine Gun for Bow character

Inctruction:
1. Assign the macro key on any button you want.
2. Walk first before clicking the macro (Press any of WASD)
3. Press and hold the Macro key to start.
4. Release the macro key to stop.

Notes:
1. Tested With Fischl and Ganyu. (This may not work on other bow user characters because of the slight difference with the delay)
2. Stable FPS is a must! (50-60 FPS)
3. If stuck at Aimed Shot, just jump or sprint to cancel the aimed shot and continue the macro.

 </Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 35 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 35 ms
LeftDown 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 13 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Genshin Impact</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>